{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1527465-w20-totem-powers-and-gifts-questions","id":1527465,"title":"W20 Totem Powers and Gifts questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-12-26T13:38:54-08:00","id":1527465,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> W20 Totem Powers and Gifts questions","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> I have some questions regarding some totem powers and gifts:<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>POWER: Totem can always find the pack members</b>.<br /> <br /> 1. Does the totem need to track to find them, or can it just tell the rest of the pack the location of the missing member?<br /> 2. Is it a direction sense (&quot;They are 400 kilometers in that direction&quot;) or is more specific (&quot;They are in the Deep Umbra, it will take us 2 days march to get there, this is the path&quot;)?<br /> 3. How does it work if the member is in another plane (Umbra or Material)? Does it automatically fail, or what does it do?<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>POWER: Totem is connected mystically to all pack members, allowing communication among them even at great distances</b>.<br /> <br /> 4. Is the Totem a switchboard (messages goes from A to the Totem, from the Totem to B, and viceversa) or goes to each intended pack member directly?<br /> 5. IF the totem is a switchboard, does it mean that it needs the Spirit Speech gift or the power that substituts it for the message to be understood?<br /> 6. Is it a broadcast (C speaks, all packmembers hear them) or point to point (A can pick a direct message to B)?<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>GIFT: Beat of the Heart-Drum / Pulse of the Prey</b><br /> <br /> 7. How does these work if the target is in another plane (Umbra or Material)? Does it automatically fail, or what does it do?<br /> 8. Which powers (Sphere, Discipline, Gift, etc) can block these gifts?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Thanks,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 11-03-2024, 02:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-26T14:30:45-08:00","id":1527468,"title":"","content":"Some likely answers.<br /> <br /> Can Always Find Pack Members<br /> Probably a direction sense for anywhere in the cosmos, barring some kind of active concealment effect.<br /> <br /> Connected to all Pack members<br /> I'm assuming that the patron can relay messages and doesn't require anyone to have Spirit Speech, if only because you already paid up to get this power.<br /> <br /> Gift Questions<br /> 7: If you need to Step Sideways, you'll feel the tugging. If you need to go past an Anchorhead into the Deep Umbra, you'll also feel it.<br /> 8: Anything that would hide you, but it goes into a roll-off, so it's never a sure thing. Ignore any Vampire crossover rules that suggest otherwise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-26T15:30:28-08:00","id":1527469,"title":"","content":"For the Totem powers, I'm not really of the mind to limit them without compelling reason. So that might bias my answers a bit, and there aren't official ones to most of this:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lbeaumanior</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1527465-w20-totem-powers-and-gifts-questions#post1527465\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>POWER: Totem can always find the pack members</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>1-3: The Totem can always find pack members. It can guide one pack member to another, know where to go to find one from whereever it is now, etc. It doesn't allow instant teleportation to them, because it just says &quot;find,&quot; but there are not restrictions regarding Realms listed, and spirits are far less limited by that than not anyway.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>POWER: Totem is connected mystically to all pack members, allowing communication among them even at great distances</b>. </div> </div> </div>4 &amp; 6: In previous editions, this power referenced the Gift Mindspeak (though that caused a lot of other confusions about it), but I hold that to the general concept: it can be the whole pack, or individuals in the pack. The spirit is technically the &quot;operator&quot; but as this is a constant effect it's more like someone that opens a Discord server and gives members the ability to make voice channels whenever they want. The spirit doesn't need to actively play &quot;switchboard&quot; or relay messages. It's just the conduit (and can participate too) that allows for the conversations to happen.<br /> 5. Spirit Speech is not needed for the pack communications to work between the pack members. However, Totems do not automatically have the ability to communicate with the pack directly (hence buying that as a seperate power is an option), so if the Totem wants to use the link to talk to the pack, only those with the Gift will understand unless that other power is also purchased.<br /> <br /> <b><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> GIFT: Beat of the Heart-Drum / Pulse of the Prey </div> </div> </div></b><br /> <br /> 7. Beat of the Heart-Drum doesn't say anything about working across Realms, just that it allow for near perfect tracking. Since tracking can't - by itself, there are powers in the game that allow tracking across Realms that would stack with this - cross the boundaries of Realm, it would lead to where the target crossed, and if the target comes back during the duration, the trail would come back too. Pulse of the Prey is written so that it works despite Realms, so that's not an issue for it.<br /> 8. Neither of these Gifts explicitly overcome supernatural stealth (though, most supernatural stealth isn't built on blocking tracking over blocking direct sensing). Unless a power specific blocks tracking, I would let the Gift user get to the general area of the target, and then resolve actively sensing them per the power used to hide. If a power blocks supernatural tracking, I would say that BofHD fails, and Pulse of the Prey gets to roll as per the target is hiding rules in the Gift.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}